%% Logistics OS - Shipment lifecycle: order -> POD -> settlement (all touchpoints)
%% Rendering: Mermaid sequenceDiagram. See docs/integration-architecture.md and docs/events.md.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CH as Channel / EDI
  participant OMS as OMS
  participant ORCH as Orchestrator (L5)
  participant ERP as ERP (SAP/Oracle)
  participant ATP as ATP/Promise
  participant INTEL as Intelligence (L4)
  participant WMS as WMS
  participant WCS as WCS / Automation
  participant TMS as TMS
  participant CAR as Carrier API / EDI
  participant DRV as Driver Mobile
  participant VIS as Visibility
  participant CUST as Customer Tracking
  participant FIN as Billing
  participant BUS as Kafka Backbone

  Note over CH,BUS: ---- 1. ORDER ----
  CH->>OMS: SubmitOrder (sync REST/EDI 850)
  OMS->>ERP: credit check + customer master (sync)
  ERP-->>OMS: credit OK / limit (idempotent read)
  OMS->>BUS: ord.order.created.v1 (async)
  OMS-->>CH: order accepted (sync, submitToken dedupe)
  BUS->>ORCH: order.created -> start workflow

  Note over CH,BUS: ---- 2. PROMISE ----
  ORCH->>ATP: ReserveAtp(order)
  ATP->>INTEL: GetEta / GetPlacement
  ORCH->>CAR: rate request (sync REST, token-bucket, cache)
  CAR-->>ORCH: quoted rate
  ORCH->>BUS: orch.promise.v1
  ORCH->>ERP: post sales order / cost accrual (async, key=docRef)
  ERP-->>BUS: erp: salesOrder/accrual ack (doc# mapped)

  Note over CH,BUS: ---- 3. FULFILL ----
  ORCH->>WMS: Allocate + Pick (command, commandId)
  WMS->>WCS: dispatch conveyor/AGV task (sync gRPC handshake)
  WCS-->>WMS: task ack + device status (taskId idempotent)
  WCS->>WMS: scan / move confirmations
  WMS->>BUS: wms.task.events.v1
  WMS->>BUS: inv.inventory.events.v1 (exactly-once effects)

  Note over CH,BUS: ---- 4. TENDER & SHIP ----
  ORCH->>TMS: TenderShipment (command)
  TMS->>CAR: create shipment + label (sync; Idempotency-Key=tenderId)
  CAR-->>TMS: tracking# / pro# + label (ZPL/PDF)
  TMS->>BUS: tms.tender.events.v1
  TMS->>BUS: tms.shipment.events.v1 (dispatched)

  Note over CH,BUS: ---- 5. DISPATCH / PICKUP ----
  ORCH->>DRV: push manifest (FCM/APNs)
  DRV->>DRV: capture pickup scans (offline queue)
  DRV->>BUS: sync scans/status (client UUID dedupe)

  Note over CH,BUS: ---- 6. IN TRANSIT ----
  CAR-->>BUS: status webhooks / EDI 214 (provider event id dedupe)
  BUS->>VIS: raw carrier status -> normalize
  VIS->>BUS: vis.milestone.events.v1
  BUS->>ORCH: milestone/ETA signals (triggers, re-opt)

  Note over CH,BUS: ---- 7. POD ----
  DRV->>DRV: capture POD: signature + photo + scan (offline)
  DRV->>BUS: delta sync POD (client UUID, append-only evidence)
  VIS->>BUS: vis.milestone.events.v1 (delivered)
  BUS->>CUST: webhook + SSE/WS + EDI 214 (HMAC, retry->DLQ)
  BUS->>FIN: shipment.delivered -> accrue charge

  Note over CH,BUS: ---- 8. SETTLEMENT ----
  FIN->>BUS: fin.charge.events.v1 (accrual)
  CAR-->>FIN: carrier invoice EDI 210 / webhook
  FIN->>FIN: freight audit + match (invoice# dedupe)
  FIN->>ERP: post GL settlement (async; idempotencyKey=settlementId)
  ERP-->>FIN: GL document# (mapped, exactly-once effects)
  FIN->>BUS: fin.settlement.events.v1 (pay/charge)
  FIN->>ERP: post customer invoice (AR)
  FIN->>CUST: invoice notification (async)

  Note over CH,BUS: Exceptions on any leg -> orch.exception.v1 (L6 control tower + L4)
